  "expertises-hero-text-html": "Innovorder for <strong>collective</strong> <strong>health care</strong> <strong data-wg-splitted>catering</strong>",
  "text-17px-html": "\n            <p>Improve the organization of your hospital restaurant according to your resources and focus on your core business: patient management. </p>\n            <p>Trust a SaaS solution!</p>\n          ",
  "image-hero-expertise-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59c43a1a01d7_sante%20hero11.avif",
  "expertise-img-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5968f51a01e4_sante11.avif",
  "expertise-img-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5968f51a01e4_sante11-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5968f51a01e4_sante11.avif 1000w",
  "title50px": "CIOs: sleep tight",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html": "\n            <p>Catering manager: optimize your organization</p>\n            <p>Thanks to our SaaS mode, we guarantee a 100% secure and easy-to-deploy solution.</p>\n            <p>Rely on state-of-the-art software, adapted to the IT architecture of your organization. </p>\n          ",
  "title50px-2": "Catering manager: optimize your organization",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-2": "\n            <p>Put digital technology to work for you to make the checkout process in your restaurant more fluid. </p>\n            <p>Say goodbye to rushes by installing smart flatbed scans.</p>\n            <p>They will also allow you to reorganize your resources, by positioning your staff on value-added tasks.</p>\n          ",
  "expertise-img-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc597b241a01db_sante22.avif",
  "expertise-img-srcset-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc597b241a01db_sante22-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc597b241a01db_sante22.avif 1000w",
  "expertise-img-src-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595d681a01e5_sante33.avif",
  "expertise-img-srcset-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595d681a01e5_sante33-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595d681a01e5_sante33.avif 1000w",
  "title50px-3": "Purchasing manager: control your budget",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-3": "\n            <p>Regardless of your structure and resources, Innovorder supports all healthcare establishments (GHT, hospitals, retirement homes, EHPAD, clinics, etc.) with an offer adapted to your real needs.</p>\n          ",
